'''White Knight Cyclops''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] event. It was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]] has Freeze Immunity, restores Shield Piercing chance and gains Massive Damage to Aku while losing Strong Against and Wave Immunity. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]].

